---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";

const title = "PelliScope API for Developers | Skin screening infrastructure";
const description =
  "Submit skin photographs to the PelliScope API and receive image-quality checks, infectious-signal screening and structured possible-match information.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical="https://pelliscope.eu/developers.html">
  <Header active="developers" />
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="developer-hero" aria-labelledby="developer-title">
      <div class="developer-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="developer-intro section-shell">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow"><span></span>PelliScope for developers</p>
          <h1 id="developer-title">Skin screening.<br /><em>One API call.</em></h1>
        </div>
        <div class="developer-intro-copy">
          <p>
            Send clear skin photographs and receive a structured screening response designed for health platforms,
            care-navigation products and clinical intake workflows.
          </p>
          <a class="button button-primary magnetic" href="https://console.pelliscope.eu" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            Open developer console <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="developer-workflow section-shell" aria-label="PelliScope API workflow">
        <article class="developer-stage input-stage" data-reveal>
          <div class="developer-stage-top"><span>01</span><small>REQUEST</small></div>
          <div class="api-request-window">
            <div class="api-window-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><code>POST /screen</code></div>
            <div class="api-photo-row">
              <figure><img src="/samples/skin-case/case-context.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span>context.webp</span></figure>
              <figure><img src="/samples/skin-case/case-close.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span>close.webp</span></figure>
              <figure><img src="/samples/skin-case/case-angle.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span>angle.webp</span></figure>
            </div>
            <div class="api-upload-status"><span>✓</span><p><strong>3 images ready</strong><small>Quality checks included</small></p></div>
          </div>
          <h2>Submit images.</h2>
          <p>Send up to three JPG, PNG or WebP photographs with the request.</p>
        </article>

        <i class="developer-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</i>

        <article class="developer-stage signal-stage" data-reveal>
          <div class="developer-stage-top"><span>02</span><small>SIGNAL</small></div>
          <div class="api-signal-window">
            <div class="api-signal-orbit" aria-hidden="true"><span><i></i></span></div>
            <small>INFECTIOUS SIGNAL</small>
            <strong>Infectious or<br />non-infectious</strong>
            <div class="api-signal-meter"><i></i></div>
            <div class="api-signal-labels"><span>Classification</span><span>Probability</span></div>
          </div>
          <h2>Read the first signal.</h2>
          <p>Receive a classification and probability as structured response fields.</p>
        </article>

        <i class="developer-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</i>

        <article class="developer-stage matches-stage" data-reveal>
          <div class="developer-stage-top"><span>03</span><small>RESULT</small></div>
          <div class="api-matches-window">
            <div class="api-matches-head"><span>25</span><p><strong>supported conditions</strong><small>Possible matches returned by confidence</small></p></div>
            <ol>
              <li><span>01</span><strong>Possible match</strong><small>confidence</small><i style="--api-match: 82%"></i></li>
              <li><span>02</span><strong>Possible match</strong><small>confidence</small><i style="--api-match: 56%"></i></li>
              <li><span>03</span><strong>Possible match</strong><small>confidence</small><i style="--api-match: 34%"></i></li>
            </ol>
            <code>{`{ guidance, disclaimer }`}</code>
          </div>
          <h2>Use structured output.</h2>
          <p>Work with ranked possible matches, guidance and safety language in your own interface.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="developer-proof-section" aria-labelledby="developer-proof-title">
      <div class="section-shell">
        <div class="developer-proof-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow dark"><span></span>Operational infographic</p>
          <h2 id="developer-proof-title">One query.<br /><em>More focused clinical time.</em></h2>
          <p>See how prepared intake, model output and API economics fit together before a teleconsultation begins.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="developer-proof-grid">
          <article class="developer-proof-card workflow-proof" data-reveal>
            <header>
              <div><small>WORKFLOW COMPARISON</small><h3>Pre-consultation efficiency.</h3></div>
              <span>+10 patients / 5hr shift</span>
            </header>
            <div class="developer-workflow-compare">
              <div>
                <p><strong>Traditional (No AI)</strong><span>10 Min / Patient</span></p>
                <div class="developer-timebar"><i>Consultation (10m)</i></div>
                <b>6 patients / hour</b>
              </div>
              <div class="is-pelliscope">
                <p><strong>With PelliScope</strong><span>~10 Min Total (Parallelized)</span></p>
                <div class="developer-timebar split"><i>Preliminary screen (3m)</i><i>Focused consult (7m)</i></div>
                <div class="developer-workflow-result"><small>AI triage saves 3 mins of discovery time per patient</small><b>8 Patients / Hour</b></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="developer-proof-card auc-proof" data-reveal>
            <header><div><small>MODEL PERFORMANCE (AUC)</small><h3>Zero-shot comparison on dermatology benchmarks.</h3></div></header>
            <div class="developer-auc-bars">
              <div><span>Grok-4</span><i><b style="--auc: 70%"></b></i><strong>0.70</strong></div>
              <div><span>GPT-5</span><i><b style="--auc: 81%"></b></i><strong>0.81</strong></div>
              <div><span>Gemini 2.5</span><i><b style="--auc: 82%"></b></i><strong>0.82</strong></div>
              <div class="is-pelliscope"><span>PelliScope</span><i><b style="--auc: 86%"></b></i><strong>0.86</strong></div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="developer-proof-card validation-proof" data-reveal>
            <header><div><small>INTERNAL VALIDATION</small><h3>Locked-test summary.</h3></div></header>
            <div class="developer-validation-stats">
              <div><strong>2,336</strong><span>Cases</span></div>
              <div><strong>0.849</strong><span>Micro AUC</span></div>
              <div><strong>0.800</strong><span>Macro AUC</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="developer-proof-tags"><span>Internal validation only</span><span>Preprint · not peer reviewed</span></div>
            <p>AUC measures ranking discrimination across thresholds, not the percentage of correct diagnoses.</p>
            <a href="https://pelliscope.in/clinical-validation.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read methods and limitations <span>↗</span></a>
          </article>

          <article class="developer-proof-card economics-proof" data-reveal>
            <header><div><small>API ECONOMICS</small><h3>Low query cost. More review capacity.</h3></div></header>
            <div class="developer-economics-stats">
              <div><strong>$0.05</strong><span>per query</span></div>
              <div><strong>$5</strong><span>per 100 cases</span></div>
              <div><strong>5–8.3h</strong><span>discovery time prepared per 100 cases</span></div>
            </div>
            <p>At three to five minutes prepared per case, clinical time can move from repetitive discovery toward focused review and additional consultations.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="api-package-section" aria-labelledby="api-package-title">
      <div class="api-package section-shell">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow dark"><span></span>PelliScope API</p>
          <h2 id="api-package-title">Simple input.<br /><em>Useful direction.</em></h2>
          <p>Image-quality checks, infectious-signal classification and 25-condition screening in one request.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="api-price-card">
          <span>API QUERY</span>
          <p><strong>$0.05</strong><small>per query</small></p>
          <ul>
            <li>Up to three photographs</li>
            <li>Structured JSON response</li>
            <li>Screening guidance included</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="button button-dark magnetic" href="https://console.pelliscope.eu" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            Open developer console <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="api-boundary section-shell">
        PelliScope API output is informational screening. It is not a diagnosis, treatment plan or emergency service.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
